<view class="page">
  <view class="title">投资回报计算器</view><view class="muted">同一座站，换一种投入与合同，回报可能大不相同。</view><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="sample">填入投资示例</button>
  <view class="card"><view class="field"><text>投资方案名称（选填）</text><input maxlength="40" value="{{form.name}}" bindinput="nameInput" placeholder="例如：城南站 · 年付租赁方案"/></view><view class="section-title">01 · 选择经营基础</view>
    <view class="tabs"><button class="btn secondary {{sourceTab === 'recent' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="recent" bindtap="tab">最近 5 条</button><button class="btn secondary {{sourceTab === 'saved' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="saved" bindtap="tab">已保存报告</button></view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="source-list" wx:if="{{sources.length}}"><view class="source {{source.id === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{sources}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectSource"><view class="history-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.date}} · {{item.period}}</view><view class="source-value">年化经营收益：{{item.value}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.legacy}}" class="muted">旧版填写数据 · 按 2.0 口径重算</view></view></scroll-view>
    <view class="note" wx:else>暂无可引用记录。可先进行利润测算，也可手动填写下方年度经营数据。</view>
    <view class="note" wx:if="{{source}}">已引用：{{source.name}} · {{sourceDate}}。采用引用时的数据快照，源记录后续修改不会自动覆盖本方案。</view><view wx:if="{{sourceError}}" class="warning">{{sourceError}}</view>
    <view class="field"><text>基准年度租金前经营 EBITDA（息税折旧摊销前利润）· 元</text><input type="text" value="{{form.annualEbitda}}" data-key="annualEbitda" bindinput="input" disabled="{{!!source}}" placeholder="可填写负数，如 -100000"/></view><text class="link" data-term="ebitda" bindtap="explain">查看说明</text><button class="btn secondary" wx:if="{{source}}" bindtap="manual">改为手动填写经营数据</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">02 · 期限与年度预测</view><view class="grid forecast-settings"><view class="field"><text>经营 / 预测年限（1–20 年）</text><input type="number" value="{{form.years}}" data-key="years" bindinput="input" bindblur="yearsBlur"/></view><view class="field"><text>年折现率（期望年回报率）<text class="label-unit">（%）</text></text><input type="digit" value="{{form.discountRate}}" data-key="discountRate" bindinput="input"/><text class="link" data-term="discount" bindtap="explain">查看说明</text></view><view class="field"><text>企业所得税测算率（%）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.incomeTaxRate}}" data-key="incomeTaxRate" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="muted">默认 0% 表示较上一年不变，第一年以基准年度为起点。点击 ▲ / ▼ 每次增减 1 个百分点，也可直接填写 +10、8、-10；负经营收益下，正比例会扩大亏损。</view>
    <view class="growth-settings-note muted">年度修正默认均为 0。投资回报与盈亏平衡销量计算器共用一份已保存设置，再次保存会覆盖；点击“填入已保存设置”应用，超出已保存年数的年份填 0。</view><view class="actions growth-actions"><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="saveGrowthSettings">保存年度修正</button><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="applyGrowthSettings" disabled="{{!hasGrowthSettings}}">填入已保存设置</button><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="resetGrowth">全部归零</button></view><view class="growth-head"><text>年份</text><text>较上年修订（%）</text><text>预计经营收益</text></view><view class="growth-row" wx:for="{{growthRows}}" wx:key="index"><text>第 {{item.year}} 年</text><view class="growth-control"><view class="growth-input-wrap"><input type="text" value="{{item.growth}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindinput="growthInput"/><text class="growth-percent">%</text></view><view class="step-buttons"><button aria-label="增加 1 个百分点" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-step="1" bindtap="growthStep">▲</button><button aria-label="减少 1 个百分点" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="growthStep">▼</button></view></view><text>{{item.preview}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">03 · 资产与前期投入</view><view class="muted">金额单位：元；资产在期初投入，按直线法、零残值折旧。折旧年限默认与经营年限一致，不能超过经营年限。</view><view wx:for="{{form.assets}}" wx:key="name" class="asset"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><text>资产投入</text><input type="digit" value="{{item.amount}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="amount" bindinput="assetInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>折旧年限</text><input type="number" value="{{item.life}}" data-index="{{index}}" data-key="life" bindinput="assetInput"/></view></view></view><view class="field"><text>其他前期投入（不自动折旧或抵税）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.otherInitial}}" data-key="otherInitial" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>流动资金（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.workingCapital}}" data-key="workingCapital" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="note">新方案默认 50 万元，可修改。期初计入投入，期末全额收回，不计费用、不折旧；首期预付租金另计，请勿重复填写。旧方案未设置此项时保留为 0。</view><text class="link" data-term="depreciation" bindtap="explain">折旧是什么？</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">04 · 租赁与合作</view><radio-group class="options" data-key="mode" bindchange="choice"><label class="option {{form.mode === index && !legacyJointMode ? 'checked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{modeOptions}}" wx:key="*this"><radio value="{{index}}" checked="{{form.mode === index && !legacyJointMode}}" color="#0068ad"/><text>{{item}}</text></label></radio-group>
    <block wx:if="{{form.mode < 2 || form.mode === 4}}"><view class="grid"><view class="field"><text>首年租金成本（元/年）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.rent}}" data-key="rent" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>年租金递增（%，可负）</text><input type="text" value="{{form.rentGrowth}}" data-key="rentGrowth" bindinput="input"/></view></view><view class="note">按实际成本口径填写，剔除可抵扣进项税。固定租金按月末付，长租短付与长租长付均按每个付款周期开始时预付。</view></block>
    <block wx:if="{{form.mode === 1}}"><view class="field"><text>租金付款频率</text><radio-group class="options" bindchange="frequency"><label class="option {{frequencyIndex === index ? 'checked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{frequencyOptions}}" wx:key="*this"><radio value="{{index}}" checked="{{frequencyIndex === index}}" color="#0068ad"/><text>{{item}}</text></label></radio-group></view><view class="field"><text>首期预付期数</text><input type="number" value="{{form.prepaidPeriods}}" data-key="prepaidPeriods" bindinput="input"/></view><text class="link" data-term="prepay" bindtap="explain">长租短付说明</text></block>
    <block wx:if="{{form.mode === 4}}"><view class="field"><text>每次预付几年租金</text><radio-group class="options inline-options" data-key="paymentYears" bindchange="choice"><label class="option {{form.paymentYears == item ? 'checked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{paymentYearOptions}}" wx:key="*this" wx:if="{{item <= form.years}}"><radio value="{{item}}" checked="{{form.paymentYears == item}}" color="#0068ad"/><text>{{item}} 年一付</text></label></radio-group><input type="number" value="{{form.paymentYears}}" data-key="paymentYears" bindinput="input" placeholder="也可填写其他年数"/></view><view class="note">每期开始时预付，末期不足一个周期只支付剩余年数。例如 10 年、2 年一付：第 1、3、5、7、9 年年初付款；首笔在初始投入中单列。</view><text class="link" data-term="longpay" bindtap="explain">长租长付说明</text></block><block wx:if="{{form.mode === 2}}"><view class="field"><text>业主动态租金比例（%）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.shareRate}}" data-key="shareRate" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="note">租金（业主分红）按扣除折旧、利息后、支付该租金前的税前利润正数 × 约定比例测算；亏损时为 0。该项作为动态租金扣除一次，按合同租金可税前列支测算，不再按股东分红扣除。</view><text class="link" data-term="sharing" bindtap="explain">查看说明</text></block>
    <view class="warning" wx:if="{{legacyJointMode}}">此旧方案使用已取消的“双方出资合作”。请选择新的租赁或合作方式后重新计算；如选择固定管理费，请再次点击该选项。原始数据保留，原出资比例不会自动转换成业主租金比例。</view>
    <block wx:if="{{form.mode === 3 && !legacyJointMode}}"><view class="field"><text>支付合作方的固定管理费（元/年）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.managementFee}}" data-key="managementFee" bindinput="input"/></view><text class="link" data-term="cooperation" bindtap="explain">固定管理费说明</text></block>
  </view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">05 · 贷款融资（选填）</view><view class="grid"><view class="field"><text>贷款金额（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.loanAmount}}" data-key="loanAmount" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>贷款年利率（%）</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.loanRate}}" data-key="loanRate" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>贷款年限</text><input type="number" value="{{form.loanYears}}" data-key="loanYears" bindinput="input"/></view></view><radio-group class="options" data-key="repayment" bindchange="choice"><label class="option {{form.repayment === index ? 'checked' : ''}}" wx:for="{{repaymentOptions}}" wx:key="*this"><radio value="{{index}}" checked="{{form.repayment === index}}" color="#0068ad"/><text>{{item}}</text></label></radio-group><text class="link" data-term="{{form.repayment === 1 ? 'bullet' : 'annuity'}}" bindtap="explain">查看还款说明</text><view class="note">所需权益资金：{{funding}}。预测期短于贷款期时，期末计入剩余本金结清。</view></view>
  <button class="btn" bindtap="calculate" disabled="{{legacyJointMode}}">计算年度净利润与投资回报</button>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}" id="investment-result"><view class="section-title">投资测算结果</view><view class="metric" wx:for="{{report.metrics}}" wx:key="label"><view class="metric-label">{{item.label}}</view><view class="metric-value">{{item.value}}</view><text class="link" data-term="{{item.term}}" bindtap="explain">查看说明</text></view><view class="warning" wx:for="{{result.warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{result.project.irrReason}}">项目内部收益率：{{result.project.irrReason}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{result.shareholder.irrReason}}">股东内部收益率：{{result.shareholder.irrReason}}</view><button class="btn" bindtap="report">查看完整投资报告 / 分享图片</button><button class="btn secondary" bindtap="savePlan">保存本地投资方案</button></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{result}}"><view class="section-title">逐年利润与现金流</view><view class="muted">左右滑动查看全部列 · 单位：万元。现金流按实际付款安排，期末含流动资金回收；与按租金归属年度计算的年均回笼口径不同。</view><scroll-view scroll-x><view class="cash-table"><view class="cash-row heading"><text>年份</text><text>经营收益</text><text>年度净利润</text><text>项目现金流</text><text>我方现金流</text><text>我方累计</text></view><view class="cash-row" wx:for="{{table}}" wx:key="year"><text>{{item.year}}</text><text>{{item.ebitdaText}}</text><text>{{item.profitText}}</text><text>{{item.projectText}}</text><text>{{item.equityText}}</text><text>{{item.cumulativeText}}</text></view></view></scroll-view></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">已保存投资方案（本地）</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!plans.length}}">保存后可反复比较不同投入与合同方案。</view><view class="history-item" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id"><view class="history-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.date}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="btn secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="restorePlan">恢复方案</button><button class="btn danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removePlan">删除</button></view></view></view>
  <button class="btn secondary" bindtap="guide">测算口径与财务概念说明</button>
</view>
